+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project's recorded decision for cache eviction is LRU (Least Recently Used) with a 300-second TTL. This value was set in `config/decisions/revoke-cache-eviction.json`, which was later relocated out of the repository tree as part of a broader move of decision configs rather than being revoked or changed.
